        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek S30003HES, Modern Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose is a great addition to any contemporary home. The brushed stainless steel finish offers durability as it is resistant to scratches, nicks, and tarnishing. This Modern Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 2-3/4 inches thick with standard 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Contemporary Hermes Door Leverset comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need to install it, just choose from passage, privacy, or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-HES-side-view.jpg?v=1704354680\" width=\"216\" height=\"78\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" atl=\"Emtek S30003HES Side View\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Contemporary Hermes Door Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Lever is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid stainless steel lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Hermes Lever with Modern Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-13/100\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-73/100\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8 - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose",
                "description": "The Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose is a great addition to any contemporary home. The brushed stainless steel finish offers durability as it is resistant to scratches, nicks, and tarnishing. This Modern Stainless Steel Hermes Lever with Square Rose will fit doors 1-3/8 inches thick to 2-3/4 inches thick with standard 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. The Contemporary Hermes Door Leverset comes packaged with all the hardware you'll need to install it, just choose from passage, privacy, or dummy functions.\r\n",
